{"id":"124259d2584af1b6","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-oracle-computation.md","title":"Oracle Computation","display":"df-oracle-computation — Oracle Computation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-oracle-computation","aliases":["68-df-oracle-computation"],"display":"df-oracle-computation — Oracle Computation","depends_on":["[[68-df-basic-machine]]","[[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]","[[68-df-sequence-code]]","[[68-df-recursive-set]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§12 pp.39-43 / PDF 48-52; singleton-set oracle and bounded-step variant","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"construction-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-oracle-computation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-oracle-computation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-computation — Oracle Computation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"87b1d4bf7c9d6143\" href=\"?note=87b1d4bf7c9d6143\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine\">68-df-basic-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"89e092f6450e5227\" href=\"?note=89e092f6450e5227\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine-computation\">68-df-basic-machine-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fee56385c180d0b9\" href=\"?note=fee56385c180d0b9\" title=\"68-df-sequence-code\">68-df-sequence-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7fc8baae87b873a3\" href=\"?note=7fc8baae87b873a3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-set\">68-df-recursive-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§12 pp.39-43 / PDF 48-52; singleton-set oracle and bounded-step variant"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"construction-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,y,s,t,q,i,j,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,x,y,s,t,q,i,j,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7fc8baae87b873a3\" href=\"?note=7fc8baae87b873a3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-set\">68-df-recursive-set</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I,\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal R\\)</span> 及寄存器更新见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"87b1d4bf7c9d6143\" href=\"?note=87b1d4bf7c9d6143\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine\">68-df-basic-machine</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{1,x}\">\\(\\rho_{1,x}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"89e092f6450e5227\" href=\"?note=89e092f6450e5227\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine-computation\">68-df-basic-machine-computation</a>。有限序列编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sc}\">\\(\\operatorname{sc}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fee56385c180d0b9\" href=\"?note=fee56385c180d0b9\" title=\"68-df-sequence-code\">68-df-sequence-code</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal P^O\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal P^O\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pc}^O:\\mathcal P^O\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{pc}^O:\\mathcal P^O\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_e^O\\in\\mathcal P^O\">\\(P_e^O\\in\\mathcal P^O\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_P^A:\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\\to\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\">\\(\\delta_P^A:\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\\to\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^A(P,x,\\cdot):\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\">\\(C^A(P,x,\\cdot):\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A,\\varphi_e^A,\\Phi_{e,s}^{A}\">\\(\\Phi_e^A,\\varphi_e^A,\\Phi_{e,s}^{A}\\)</span> 都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\\)</span> 的子集。下式对每个集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 定义同一有界计算算子；阶段序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((A_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 的用法是将该算子的集合参数取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s\">\\(A_s\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I^O:=\\mathcal I\\cup\\{(3,i,j):i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\land i\\ne j\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P^O:=\\{P\\in(\\mathcal I^O)^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\;\\forall i,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;((P(q)=(1,i,n)\\lor P(q)=(2,n))\\Rightarrow n&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I^O:=\\mathcal I\\cup\\{(3,i,j):i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\land i\\ne j\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P^O:=\\{P\\in(\\mathcal I^O)^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\;\\forall i,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;((P(q)=(1,i,n)\\lor P(q)=(2,n))\\Rightarrow n&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pc}^O(P):=\\operatorname{sc}((\\operatorname{sc}(P(q)))_{q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)}),\\quad\\mathrm{Prog}^O:=\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{pc}^O),\\quad\nP_e^O:=\\begin{cases}P&amp;e=\\operatorname{pc}^O(P),\\ P\\in\\mathcal P^O,\\\\()&amp;e\\notin\\mathrm{Prog}^O.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pc}^O(P):=\\operatorname{sc}((\\operatorname{sc}(P(q)))_{q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)}),\\quad\\mathrm{Prog}^O:=\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{pc}^O),\\quad\nP_e^O:=\\begin{cases}P&amp;e=\\operatorname{pc}^O(P),\\ P\\in\\mathcal P^O,\\\\()&amp;e\\notin\\mathrm{Prog}^O.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_P^A(q,\\rho):=\\begin{cases}\n(q,\\rho)&amp;q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P),\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)+1])&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(0,i),\\\\\n(n,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)-1])&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)&gt;0,\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho)&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)=0,\\\\\n(n,\\rho)&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(2,n),\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho[j\\leftarrow\\chi_A(\\rho(i))])&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(3,i,j).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_P^A(q,\\rho):=\\begin{cases}\n(q,\\rho)&amp;q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P),\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)+1])&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(0,i),\\\\\n(n,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)-1])&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)&gt;0,\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho)&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)=0,\\\\\n(n,\\rho)&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(2,n),\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho[j\\leftarrow\\chi_A(\\rho(i))])&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(3,i,j).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C^A(P,x,0):=(0,\\rho_{1,x}),\\qquad C^A(P,x,t+1):=\\delta_P^A(C^A(P,x,t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C^A(P,x,0):=(0,\\rho_{1,x}),\\qquad C^A(P,x,t+1):=\\delta_P^A(C^A(P,x,t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A:=\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:e\\in\\mathrm{Prog}^O\\land\\exists t,q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;(C^A(P_e^O,x,t)=(q,\\rho)\\land q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P_e^O)\\land\\rho(0)=y)\\},\\qquad\\varphi_e^A:=\\Phi_e^A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_e^A:=\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:e\\in\\mathrm{Prog}^O\\land\\exists t,q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;(C^A(P_e^O,x,t)=(q,\\rho)\\land q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P_e^O)\\land\\rho(0)=y)\\},\\qquad\\varphi_e^A:=\\Phi_e^A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{e,s}^{A}:=\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:x\\le s\\land e\\in\\mathrm{Prog}^O\\land\\exists t\\le s\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;(C^{A}(P_e^O,x,t)=(q,\\rho)\\land q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P_e^O)\\land\\rho(0)=y)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_{e,s}^{A}:=\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:x\\le s\\land e\\in\\mathrm{Prog}^O\\land\\exists t\\le s\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;(C^{A}(P_e^O,x,t)=(q,\\rho)\\land q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P_e^O)\\land\\rho(0)=y)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §12，印刷 pp.39–43 / PDF pp.48–52。原书为每个全函数 oracle 增加读取指令，并对有限 oracle 列表编码；本节点取单个集合的表示函数，并因本目录 χ 约定调整 0/1。确定性给出单值的函数图。阶段图以输入与执行步数双重界定，故有限；A_s 变化时不保证图单调，收敛使用的有限查询见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3602b7d0a6be1b32\" href=\"?note=3602b7d0a6be1b32\" title=\"68-thm-oracle-finite-use\">68-thm-oracle-finite-use</a>。</p>\n<p>此修订去掉旧定义中未绑定的 Φ_e、S 参数及与 W_e（函数定义域）冲突的“规则枚举集”。普通索引采用基本程序编码，oracle 索引采用扩充程序编码；对普通程序 e 二者计算一致，但不能把 φ_e^∅ 与 φ_e 对每个 e 都直接写成相等。oracle 空集程序可有效消去读取指令，所以两套编号枚举相同的偏递归函数类；停机集的度相同，并不要求两个停机集合逐元素相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-basic-machine","status":"resolved","id":"87b1d4bf7c9d6143","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-basic-machine-computation","status":"resolved","id":"89e092f6450e5227","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"fee56385c180d0b9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-sequence-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"7fc8baae87b873a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"7fc8baae87b873a3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e,x,y,s,t,q,i,j,n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\chi_A$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]；$\\mathcal I,\\mathcal R$ 及寄存器更新见 [[68-df-basic-machine]]，$\\rho_{1,x}$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]。有限序列编码 $\\operatorname{sc}$ 见 [[68-df-sequence-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-basic-machine","status":"resolved","id":"87b1d4bf7c9d6143","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e,x,y,s,t,q,i,j,n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\chi_A$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]；$\\mathcal I,\\mathcal R$ 及寄存器更新见 [[68-df-basic-machine]]，$\\rho_{1,x}$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]。有限序列编码 $\\operatorname{sc}$ 见 [[68-df-sequence-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-basic-machine-computation","status":"resolved","id":"89e092f6450e5227","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e,x,y,s,t,q,i,j,n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\chi_A$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]；$\\mathcal I,\\mathcal R$ 及寄存器更新见 [[68-df-basic-machine]]，$\\rho_{1,x}$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]。有限序列编码 $\\operatorname{sc}$ 见 [[68-df-sequence-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"fee56385c180d0b9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e,x,y,s,t,q,i,j,n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\chi_A$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]；$\\mathcal I,\\mathcal R$ 及寄存器更新见 [[68-df-basic-machine]]，$\\rho_{1,x}$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]。有限序列编码 $\\operatorname{sc}$ 见 [[68-df-sequence-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-oracle-finite-use","status":"resolved","id":"3602b7d0a6be1b32","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"对应 §12，印刷 pp.39–43 / PDF pp.48–52。原书为每个全函数 oracle 增加读取指令，并对有限 oracle 列表编码；本节点取单个集合的表示函数，并因本目录 χ 约定调整 0/1。确定性给出单值的函数图。阶段图以输入与执行步数双重界定，故有限；A_s 变化时不保证图单调，收敛使用的有限查询见 [[68-thm-oracle-finite-use]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"e,x,y,s,t,q,i,j,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I,\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_{1,x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sc}","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathcal P^O","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pc}^O:\\mathcal P^O\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"P_e^O\\in\\mathcal P^O","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_P^A:\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R\\to\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"C^A(P,x,\\cdot):\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\times\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^A,\\varphi_e^A,\\Phi_{e,s}^{A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"(A_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"A_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I^O:=\\mathcal I\\cup\\{(3,i,j):i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\land i\\ne j\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P^O:=\\{P\\in(\\mathcal I^O)^{<\\omega}:\\forall q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\;\\forall i,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;((P(q)=(1,i,n)\\lor P(q)=(2,n))\\Rightarrow n<\\operatorname{lh}(P))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pc}^O(P):=\\operatorname{sc}((\\operatorname{sc}(P(q)))_{q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)}),\\quad\\mathrm{Prog}^O:=\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{pc}^O),\\quad\nP_e^O:=\\begin{cases}P&e=\\operatorname{pc}^O(P),\\ P\\in\\mathcal P^O,\\\\()&e\\notin\\mathrm{Prog}^O.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta_P^A(q,\\rho):=\\begin{cases}\n(q,\\rho)&q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P),\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)+1])&q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(0,i),\\\\\n(n,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)-1])&q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)>0,\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho)&q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)=0,\\\\\n(n,\\rho)&q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(2,n),\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho[j\\leftarrow\\chi_A(\\rho(i))])&q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(3,i,j).\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"C^A(P,x,0):=(0,\\rho_{1,x}),\\qquad C^A(P,x,t+1):=\\delta_P^A(C^A(P,x,t)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^A:=\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:e\\in\\mathrm{Prog}^O\\land\\exists t,q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;(C^A(P_e^O,x,t)=(q,\\rho)\\land q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P_e^O)\\land\\rho(0)=y)\\},\\qquad\\varphi_e^A:=\\Phi_e^A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_{e,s}^{A}:=\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:x\\le s\\land e\\in\\mathrm{Prog}^O\\land\\exists t\\le s\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\;(C^{A}(P_e^O,x,t)=(q,\\rho)\\land q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P_e^O)\\land\\rho(0)=y)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":3947,"backlinks":[{"id":"dad7e17cfa2772ae","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"对应 8.4（p.23 / PDF p.32）及 §14 的 W_{e,s}（p.49 / PDF p.58）。本节点采用 ≤s 并显式加输入界，原书采用 <s 的计算编号界，故不是声称阶段编号逐数相同。每阶段只有有限输入候选，有限记录检验可判定；界随 s 增长，最终包含每个真实停机记录。oracle 阶段在 oracle 改变时可反复变化，不能把此处的单调性移植到 [[68-df-oracle-computation]]。"},{"id":"31939e9d65c515ab","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$e,x,s_0,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\vec A=(A_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)^{\\mathbb N}$。oracle 程序 $P_e^O$、合法索引集 $\\mathrm{Prog}^O$、配置序列 $C^A$、寄存器赋值空间 $\\mathcal R$ 见 [[68-df-oracle-computation]]。$Q(e,A,x,t)$ 为前 $t$ 步实际查询的自然数集合，$\\mathrm{Preserve}$ 依赖整个阶段 oracle 序列。"},{"id":"f056ea86f9505c97","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s,i,x\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in\\{0,1\\}$。有限序列及连接见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]，$\\Phi_{e,s}^{D}$ 见 [[68-df-oracle-computation]]，查询界 $u_s(e,D,x)$ 见 [[68-df-finite-use-preservation]]，$\\chi_D$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]。"},{"id":"a48deec92f1ddb01","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\varphi_e^A$ 是 [[68-df-oracle-computation]] 定义的 oracle 偏函数。"},{"id":"36459bc8c6a3f6a6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e,n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\varphi_e^A$ 的固定 oracle 程序编号见 [[68-df-oracle-computation]]。$A'$ 及有限迭代 $A^{(n)}$ 在下式定义。"},{"id":"7ed23faee951231d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\varphi_e^B$ 见 [[68-df-oracle-computation]]，$\\chi_A$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]。$\\le_T$ 与其严格部分 $<_T$ 在下式定义。"},{"id":"fcd2a2bd1b358916","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[68-df-friedberg-muchnik-stages]] 唯一确定的阶段数据 $C_s$、$\\mathrm{FMAct}$、$\\alpha_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\beta_{\\mathrm{FM}},\\gamma_{\\mathrm{FM}}$ 及极限集合 $A_{\\mathrm{FM}},B_{\\mathrm{FM}}$。$\\mathrm{TotalRec}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-function]]；$\\mathrm{FinInjury}$ 见 [[68-df-finite-injury]]；$\\mathrm{RE}$、$\\le_T$、$\\Phi_e^D$ 分别见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]、[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]、[[68-df-oracle-computation]]。$\\chi_D$ 沿用该 oracle 接口的集合表示函数。有限查询保持使用 [[68-thm-oracle-finite-use]]。"},{"id":"e061a6cb0c6ad653","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{1\\text{-}Generic}$ 见 [[68-df-one-generic-set]]。$\\mathrm{Recursive}$、跳跃 $G'$、$\\equiv_T$、有效并 $\\oplus$ 分别见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]、[[68-df-turing-jump]]、[[68-df-turing-equivalence]]、[[68-df-effective-join]]。oracle 程序及其有限查询性质见 [[68-df-oracle-computation]]、[[68-thm-oracle-finite-use]]。"},{"id":"3602b7d0a6be1b32","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e,x,y\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\varphi_e^A$ 与 $C^A$ 见 [[68-df-oracle-computation]]。$u$ 作为 von Neumann 自然数表示 $\\{0,\\ldots,u-1\\}$。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-oracle-computation]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-oracle-computation]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"相对计算与度：[[68-df-oracle-computation]] → [[68-df-turing-reducibility]] → [[68-df-turing-degree]]；[[68-df-turing-jump]]、[[68-thm-posts-theorem]]、[[68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-theorem]]。"}],"outgoing":["87b1d4bf7c9d6143","89e092f6450e5227","fee56385c180d0b9","7fc8baae87b873a3","3602b7d0a6be1b32"]}